note server/nodoor.om: the seam of door/ (the event stream and the feed) for a build that does not
note compose it (door/READY missing, or collab/ or social/ not composed, as in a store-reading build):
note <base>events.json, <base>events and <base>feed answer 501, the forge row has no Feed entry, and
note agents.json lists those addresses under not_available.
text tevpj "/events.json"
text tevpe "/events"
text tevpf "/feed"
fn evroute to long
if fpeq tevpj
fqajsn
ret 501
end
if or fpeq tevpe fpeq tevpf
ret 501
end
ret 0
end
fn evnav to void
end
fn evon to bool
ret false
end
